ry":"1","duration":90,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787739861.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"CKiF - Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Sucha Beskidzka","city_id":2293,"zip":"34-200","addresse":"Mickiewicza 27"}},"4897":{"id":4897,"title":"Marsupilami Dubbing PL ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-dubbing-pl-2026-09-25-15-00-1-1-1-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1227\/1787764513.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":302,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 14:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-26 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":1800,"price":"18,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":302}]},"event":{"id":1227,"name":"Marsupilami Dubbing PL ","description":"Komedia dla ca\u0142ej rodziny \u2013 od lat 5 do 105 \u2013 od scenarzysty kultowych film\u00f3w \u201eAsterix i Obelix: Misja Kleopatra\u201d oraz \u201eMiko\u0142ajek\u201d. Szalona, pe\u0142na humoru przygoda, w kt\u00f3rej w centrum akcji znajduje si\u0119 prawdziwy psotnik \u2013 tajemnicze stworzenie MARSUPILAMI!<br><br>W polskiej wersji j\u0119zykowej us\u0142yszymy plejad\u0119 gwiazd: Cezarego Pazur\u0119, Magdalen\u0119 Boczarsk\u0105, Mateusza Banasiuka i Tomasza O\u015bwieci\u0144skiego.<br><br>Podczas rejsu all-inclusive David, Tess i ich synek odkrywaj\u0105 w swoim baga\u017cu uroczego, \u017c\u00f3\u0142tego stworka w czarne c\u0119tki, kt\u00f3rego niewyobra\u017calnie d\u0142ugi ogon i nieposkromiony temperament w mgnieniu oka zamieniaj\u0105 rodzinne wakacje w totalny chaos \u2013 zw\u0142aszcza gdy okazuje si\u0119, \u017ce nowego przyjaciela ch\u0142opca pr\u00f3buje odnale\u017a\u0107 zdecydowanie zbyt wiele os\u00f3b!","oryginal_title":"Marsupilami  ","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"Kino","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":98,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1227\/1787764513.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"CKiF - Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Sucha Beskidzka","city_id":2293,"zip":"34-200","addresse":"Mickiewicza 27"}},"4900":{"id":4900,"title":"100 dni: Misja Zeus Film PL ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/100-dni-misja-zeus-film-pl-2026-09-18-17-00-1-1-1-1-1-1-1-1-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1225\/1787739642.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":302,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 16:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-26 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":1800,"price":"18,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":302}]},"event":{"id":1225,"name":"100 dni: Misja Zeus Film PL ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Kontynuacja jednego z najg\u0142o\u015bniejszych m\u0142odzie\u017cowych film\u00f3w ostatnich lat. Tym razem bohaterowie wychodz\u0105 poza szkolne mury, a stawka jest wi\u0119ksza ni\u017c kiedykolwiek wcze\u015bniej - cho\u0107 oni sami nie czuj\u0105 si\u0119 na ni\u0105 gotowi. Kapsel i jego ekipa stawiaj\u0105 pierwsze kroki w doros\u0142ym \u017cyciu. Jedni ruszyli ju\u017c dalej, inni pr\u00f3buj\u0105 pouk\u0142ada\u0107 \u017cycie po swojemu, a Kapsel\u2026 nie potrafi si\u0119 odnale\u017a\u0107. Mieszka z rodzicami, w pracy po\u017cegna\u0142 si\u0119 z ambicjami i coraz cz\u0119\u015bciej zadaje sobie pytanie, czy najlepszy czas ma za sob\u0105. Kiedy jednak na horyzoncie pojawia si\u0119 misja, od kt\u00f3rej mo\u017ce zale\u017ce\u0107 przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 wielu ludzi, nie ma czasu na w\u0105tpliwo\u015bci.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":112,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1225\/1787739642.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"CKiF - Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Sucha Beskidzka","city_id":2293,"zip":"34-200","addresse":"Mickiewicza 27"}},"4903":{"id":4903,"title":"Resident Evil Napisy PL ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/resident-evil-napisy-pl-2026-09-18-19-30-1-1-1-1-1-1-2-1-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787739861.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T19:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":302,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 18:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-26 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 19:30:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":1800,"price":"18,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":302}]},"event":{"id":1226,"name":"Resident Evil Napisy PL ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Awaria laboratorium Umbrelli powoduje niekontrolowane uwolnienie wirusa. Mieszka\u0144cy Raccoon przemieniaj\u0105 si\u0119 w bezlitosne, krwio\u017cercze istoty. Bryan, przypadkowy \u015bwiadek katastrofy, zostaje uwi\u0119ziony po\u015br\u00f3d chaosu miasta.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"Czechy, Francja, Niemcy, USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":90,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787739861.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"CKiF - Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Sucha Beskidzka","city_id":2293,"zip":"34-200","addresse":"Mickiewicza 27"}},"4945":{"id":4945,"title":"Zapomniana wyspa Dubbing PL ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/zapomniana-wyspa-dubbing-pl-2026-10-02-14-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789990786.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T14:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":302,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 13:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 14:30:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":1800,"price":"18,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":302}]},"event":{"id":1242,"name":"Zapomniana wyspa Dubbing PL ","description":"Przyja\u017a\u0144 mi\u0119dzy pe\u0142n\u0105 werwy i \u017c\u0105dn\u0105 przyg\u00f3d Jo, a odpowiedzialn\u0105 i rozs\u0105dn\u0105 Raiss\u0105, trwa od szko\u0142y podstawowej. W ko\u0144cu staj\u0105 u progu doros\u0142o\u015bci, a Raissa wyje\u017cd\u017ca na studia. Po\u017cegnalny wiecz\u00f3r zamienia si\u0119 w niezwyk\u0142\u0105 podr\u00f3\u017c.<br><br>Za spraw\u0105 tajemniczego portalu trafiaj\u0105 na legendarn\u0105 wysp\u0119 Nakali, tajemniczy \u015bwiat inspirowany filipi\u0144sk\u0105 mitologi\u0105, zamieszkany przez fascynuj\u0105ce stworzenia, magiczne istoty, ale i niebezpiecze\u0144stwa czaj\u0105ce si\u0119 za ka\u017cdym rogiem. Wraz z pechowym, lecz uroczym wilko\u0142akiem Rawwem i grup\u0105 nowych sprzymierze\u0144c\u00f3w dziewczyny musz\u0105 stawi\u0107 czo\u0142a budz\u0105cej groz\u0119 Manananggal, najpot\u0119\u017cniejszej istocie wyspy.<br><br>Szybko odkrywaj\u0105 jednak, \u017ce najwi\u0119ksze zagro\u017cenie nie kryje si\u0119 w mroku Nakali, bo aby wr\u00f3ci\u0107 do domu, b\u0119d\u0105 musia\u0142y zap\u0142aci\u0107 niewyobra\u017caln\u0105 cen\u0119: utrat\u0119 wszystkich wspomnie\u0144 o swojej przyja\u017ani.","oryginal_title":"Forgotten Island","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":110,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789990786.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"CKiF - Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Sucha Beskidzka","city_id":2293,"zip":"34-200","addresse":"Mickiewicza 27"}},"4916":{"id":4916,"title":"Tony Napisy PL ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tony-napisy-pl-2026-10-02-16-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789729622.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T16:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":302,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 15:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-18 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 16:45:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":1800,"price":"18,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":302}]},"event":{"id":1232,"name":"Tony Napisy PL ","description":"Anthony Bourdain \u2013 buntownik, outsider, g\u0142os pokolenia, jeden z najbardziej znanych szef\u00f3w kuchni i jedna z najwi\u0119kszych, najbardziej charyzmatycznych osobowo\u015bci telewizyjnych. Podr\u00f3\u017cnik, pisarz, odkrywca, kt\u00f3rego miliony ludzi na ca\u0142ym \u015bwiecie pokocha\u0142y za bezkompromisowy styl, mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 do \u017cycia, szacunek do ludzi, odwag\u0119, ciekawo\u015b\u0107 \u015bwiata i autentyczno\u015b\u0107.<br><br>TONY to historia pocz\u0105tk\u00f3w jego drogi \u2013 kim by\u0142, zanim sta\u0142 si\u0119 Anthonym Bourdainem. Upalne lato 1976 roku, Provincetown \u2013 miasto pulsuj\u0105ce wolno\u015bci\u0105, seksem i energi\u0105. M\u0142ody, marz\u0105cy o karierze pisarza, Anthony Bourdain (Dominic Sessa), by podreperowa\u0107 bud\u017cet, trafia na zmywak do restauracji serwuj\u0105cej owoce morza, prowadzonej przez tajemniczego szefa kuchni (Antonio Banderas). W intensywnej, chaotycznej, a jednocze\u015bnie niezwykle kreatywnej atmosferze Tony odkrywa swoj\u0105 pasj\u0119, powo\u0142anie i to, kim tak naprawd\u0119 jest.","oryginal_title":"tony","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":104,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789729622.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"CKiF - Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Sucha Beskidzka","city_id":2293,"zip":"34-200","addresse":"Mickiewicza 27"}},"4913":{"id":4913,"title":"Lalka Film PL ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-film-pl-2026-10-07-18-00-1-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789726248.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T19:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":281,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-18 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 19:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":1800,"price":"18,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":281}]},"event":{"id":1231,"name":"Lalka Film PL ","description":"Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny.<br><br>U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi.<br><br>To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.","oryginal_title":"lalka","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789726248.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"CKiF - Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Sucha Beskidzka","city_id":2293,"zip":"34-200","addresse":"Mickiewicza 27"}},"4946":{"id":4946,"title":"Zapomniana wyspa Dubbing PL ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/zapomniana-wyspa-dubbing-pl-2026-10-02-14-30-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789990786.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T14:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":302,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 13:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 14:30:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":1800,"price":"18,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":302}]},"event":{"id":1242,"name":"Zapomniana wyspa Dubbing PL ","description":"Przyja\u017a\u0144 mi\u0119dzy pe\u0142n\u0105 werwy i \u017c\u0105dn\u0105 przyg\u00f3d Jo, a odpowiedzialn\u0105 i rozs\u0105dn\u0105 Raiss\u0105, trwa od szko\u0142y podstawowej. W ko\u0144cu staj\u0105 u progu doros\u0142o\u015bci, a Raissa wyje\u017cd\u017ca na studia. Po\u017cegnalny wiecz\u00f3r zamienia si\u0119 w niezwyk\u0142\u0105 podr\u00f3\u017c.<br><br>Za spraw\u0105 tajemniczego portalu trafiaj\u0105 na legendarn\u0105 wysp\u0119 Nakali, tajemniczy \u015bwiat inspirowany filipi\u0144sk\u0105 mitologi\u0105, zamieszkany przez fascynuj\u0105ce stworzenia, magiczne istoty, ale i niebezpiecze\u0144stwa czaj\u0105ce si\u0119 za ka\u017cdym rogiem. Wraz z pechowym, lecz uroczym wilko\u0142akiem Rawwem i grup\u0105 nowych sprzymierze\u0144c\u00f3w dziewczyny musz\u0105 stawi\u0107 czo\u0142a budz\u0105cej groz\u0119 Manananggal, najpot\u0119\u017cniejszej istocie wyspy.<br><br>Szybko odkrywaj\u0105 jednak, \u017ce najwi\u0119ksze zagro\u017cenie nie kryje si\u0119 w mroku Nakali, bo aby wr\u00f3ci\u0107 do domu, b\u0119d\u0105 musia\u0142y zap\u0142aci\u0107 niewyobra\u017caln\u0105 cen\u0119: utrat\u0119 wszystkich wspomnie\u0144 o swojej przyja\u017ani.","oryginal_title":"Forgotten Island","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":110,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789990786.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"CKiF - Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Sucha Beskidzka","city_id":2293,"zip":"34-200","addresse":"Mickiewicza 27"}},"4917":{"id":4917,"title":"Tony Napisy PL ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tony-napisy-pl-2026-10-02-16-45-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789729622.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T16:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":302,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 15:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-18 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 16:45:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":1800,"price":"18,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":302}]},"event":{"id":1232,"name":"Tony Napisy PL ","description":"Anthony Bourdain \u2013 buntownik, outsider, g\u0142os pokolenia, jeden z najbardziej znanych szef\u00f3w kuchni i jedna z najwi\u0119kszych, najbardziej charyzmatycznych osobowo\u015bci telewizyjnych. Podr\u00f3\u017cnik, pisarz, odkrywca, kt\u00f3rego miliony ludzi na ca\u0142ym \u015bwiecie pokocha\u0142y za bezkompromisowy styl, mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 do \u017cycia, szacunek do ludzi, odwag\u0119, ciekawo\u015b\u0107 \u015bwiata i autentyczno\u015b\u0107.<br><br>TONY to historia pocz\u0105tk\u00f3w jego drogi \u2013 kim by\u0142, zanim sta\u0142 si\u0119 Anthonym Bourdainem. Upalne lato 1976 roku, Provincetown \u2013 miasto pulsuj\u0105ce wolno\u015bci\u0105, seksem i energi\u0105. M\u0142ody, marz\u0105cy o karierze pisarza, Anthony Bourdain (Dominic Sessa), by podreperowa\u0107 bud\u017cet, trafia na zmywak do restauracji serwuj\u0105cej owoce morza, prowadzonej przez tajemniczego szefa kuchni (Antonio Banderas). W intensywnej, chaotycznej, a jednocze\u015bnie niezwykle kreatywnej atmosferze Tony odkrywa swoj\u0105 pasj\u0119, powo\u0142anie i to, kim tak naprawd\u0119 jest.","oryginal_title":"tony","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":104,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789729622.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"CKiF - Sala widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Sucha Beskidzka","city_id":2293,"zip":"34-200","addresse":"Mickiewicza 27"}},"4914":{"id":4914,"title":"Lalka Film PL ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-film-pl-2026-10-07-18-00-1-1-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789726248.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T19:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":272,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-18 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 19:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":1800,"price":"18,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":272}]},"event":{"id":1231,"name":"Lalka Film PL ","description":"Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Ser